<title>SLOVENIA: SLOVENIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970124).</title>
<headline>SLOVENIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970124).</headline>
<text>
<p>SLOVENIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970124)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 24 Jan 97 - Prime Minister Janez Drnovsek of the Liberal  *</p>
<p> *		 Democrats proposed a new government in	  *</p>
<p> *		 coalition with the United List of Social	*</p>
<p> *		 Democrats, Desus and Nationalist Party.	 *</p>
<p> *		 The government has yet to be approved by	*</p>
<p> *		 parliament.					     *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President.........................................Milan KUCAN</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (proposed 24 Jan 1997)</p>
<p>(See end of list for party affiliations)</p>
<p> Prime Minister...........................Janez DRNOVSEK (LDS)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Forestry........................yet to be named</p>
<p> Culture.....................................Jozef SKOLC (LDS)</p>
<p> Defence....................................Boris SOVIC (ZLSD)</p>
<p> Economic Activities......................Metod DRAGONJA (LDS)</p>
<p> Economic Relations &amp; Development.......Franci KRIZANIC (ZLSD)</p>
<p> Education &amp; Sports.........................Slavko GABER (LDS)</p>
<p> Environment................................Pavel GANTAR (LDS)</p>
<p> Finance...................................Mitja GASPARI (LDS)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs............................Zoran THALER (LDS)</p>
<p> Health......................................Janez KOPAC (LDS)</p>
<p> Internal Affairs.........................Polonca DOBRAJC (NS)</p>
<p> Justice.......................................yet to be named</p>
<p> Labour, Family &amp; Social Affairs...............Anton ROP (LDS)</p>
<p> Science &amp; Technology.........................Lev KREFT (ZLSD)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Communications............Janez KOCIJANCIC (ZLSD)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS WITHOUT PORTFOLIO:</p>
<p>Coordination of Social Security Bodies... Janko KUSAR (Desus)  European affairs...........................Borut PAHOR (ZLSD)</p>
<p> Local Communities...........................Igor BAVCAR (LDS)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p> President of Parliament........................Janez PODOBNIK</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor............................France ARHAR</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>LDS - Liberal Democratic Party</p>
<p>ZLSD - United List of Social Democrats</p>
<p>NS - Nationalist Party</p>
<p>Desus - A party representing pensioners</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			  (End Government List)</p>
</text>
